category: Libs
requires: cygwin libfftw3_3 libgcc1 libstdc++6 python312 python312-numpy
sdesc: "Highly optimized physical simulation of a violin for sound synthesis (python312 bindings)"
ldesc: "Artifastring (artificial fast string) is a highly optimized physical
simulation of string quartet instruments (violins, violas, and cellos) for
sound synthesis."
external-source: artifastring

